    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-034-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) Ch. XV: eggs as solids of revolution of a definite, species-varying family of ovoid meridian curves (Preston 1953 family on Biggins et al. 2018 / Deeming 2018 data) — Morphological realism / specimen match: 42/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "The vendored specimen set (`biggins2018_C126_uria_aalge_silhouette.jpg` and four Museum Wiesbaden photographs of owl, grebe, lapwing and guillemot eggs) is SHA-256 pinned but never loaded; the figure shows only published fitted curves, so neither the axisymmetry (solid-of-revolution) test nor a photograph-to-family fit exists." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/specimen-match" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "docs/media/t1917_034_on_the_shapes_of_eggs_and_of_c_comparison.png (generated output, not in repo): 4-panel v1 figure: range-set gallery, morphospace, species elongation bars, Deeming PC2 vs relative egg mass; no specimen overlay — docs/media/t1917_034_on_the_shapes_of_eggs_and_of_c_comparison.png: rendered output of thompson/claims/t1917-034_on-the-shapes-of-eggs-and-of-certain-other-hollo.py at 83b41df2a, image/png, 301794 B, 1540×1100 px, artifact_sha256 6b6ab119d0c53b000d31126af07540589cb3cefe66a034128faca3bb8eb7e566 (sha256 6b6ab119d0c53b000d31126af07540589cb3cefe66a034128faca3bb8eb7e566), spec_fingerprint 7f3cb7ceffd0305bc161370b241783acb708b5e9be3e83c757bf5c363fc7a7f4",
            "thompson/claims/t1917-034_on-the-shapes-of-eggs-and-of-certain-other-hollo.py L160–L222: Comparison figure draws published Preston curves and scatter data; no image is opened <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/83b41df2a/thompson/claims/t1917-034_on-the-shapes-of-eggs-and-of-certain-other-hollo.py#L160-L222>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-034-specimen-match-1> ;
        pk:hasScore "0.42"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

